\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Agent 
\begin_inset Formula $i$
\end_inset

's Marshallian demand for good 
\begin_inset Formula $l$
\end_inset

 is the function, denoted 
\begin_inset Formula $x_{l}^{M^{i}}$
\end_inset

, defined by:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula $\begin{array}{cccc}
x_{l}^{M^{i}}: & \mathbb{R}_{++}^{L} & \longrightarrow & \mathbb{R}_{+}\end{array}$
\end_inset


